> References

- Burges (2010). [From RankNet to LambdaRank to LambdaMART|https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/publication/from-ranknet-to-lambdarank-to-lambdamart-an-overview/].
- Cao et al. (2007). [Learning to Rank: From Pairwise Approach to Listwise Approach|https://doi.org/10.1145/1273496.1273513].
